{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026a3pfORBo3E1792670855.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>【璀璨之城】第九集精華 豪門兄弟互相欺騙 雙面人已屬常見之事</p><p></p><p>兩兄弟表面上宣布聯手，但暗地裏卻牽制對方嘅勢力。而孝賢更化身雙面人，偷偷與敵人聯手，意圖令計劃失敗。</p><p></p><p>璀璨之城｜星期一至五 晚上08:30 PM｜翡翠台</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:19.399442+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:18:03.416844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:57:47.473963+00:00","content_hash":"7cce0cad1360edeabbb432b085c04957437b0c8cd694330ad72667bddb32a447","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:19.399442+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}